- **Added:** first zirconia-wideband-electrochemical-O2 family on a glass-furnace crown with a recomputable x=k_z·(I−I0) (`6.00 volpct`) plus pump-flow identity and three-party collusion including the ZRO infra owner; first Rogowski-coil family on an EAF bus with recomputable I=k_r·V/f (`20.00 kA`) and I·f identity, plus a resolved-innocent coil tech (timezone-skipped integrator-zero, not last-to-badge); first beta-attenuation-BAM family on a sinter baghouse with recomputable C=k_b·(I0−I)/Q (`24.00 mg/m3`) plus mass identity; bounded ACCEPT whose out-of-scope clause is adjacent baghouse compartments rather than a hopper/taphole/dump cap; operational t2 on all three (damper hold, new-coil restart, skip-compartment refusal); provenance trio designed/hil/simulated; 18 min / 24 min / 12 min slow floors in-stream.
- **Still thin:** (i) 175's k_z is a lumped mA→volpct gain, not a T/P/Nernst-slope table — a thermal hop that fakes 6.00 volpct inside a 0.80 Nernstveil corridor is unwritten; (ii) 176's k_r is a lumped coil factor, not a temperature/position map, so a V hop that fakes 20.00 kA is unwritten; (iii) 177's k_b is a lumped beta-attenuation factor, not a humidity / tape-mass table, so an I hop that fakes 24.00 mg/m3 inside a 4.80 last-good is unwritten; (iv) vendor-only as a *lead* REJECT on a plant with *no* independent zirconia/Rogowski/BAM installed yet remains slightly harder — 175/176 still have plant heads; (v) stream amplitudes remain authored constants (raster draws are the only seeded noise); (vi) r46 densification leftovers (T/P susceptibility, wedge-delay map, TEOM Q-bias) and r31 two-color LII leftover were left for those rounds' owners.